NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-7020](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7020)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nFrom slack message\r\n\r\nReporter: jasonk\r\n\r\nyb_pg_select_distinct has been failing for a long time on 2.18\r\n\r\n```\r\n*** 145,155 ****\r\n     ->  Unique (actual rows=1 loops=1)\r\n           ->  Sort (actual rows=1 loops=1)\r\n                 Sort Key: att.attnum, att.attname, (format_type(ty.oid, NULL::integer)), att.attnotnull, att.atthasdef\r\n!                Sort Method: quicksort  Memory: 349kB\r\n!                ->  Nested Loop (actual rows=2023 loops=1)\r\n!                      ->  Index Scan using pg_attribute_relid_attnum_index on pg_attribute att (actual rows=2023 loops=1)\r\n                             Index Cond: (attnum > 0)\r\n                             Filter: (attisdropped IS FALSE)\r\n!                      ->  Index Scan using pg_type_oid_index on pg_type ty (actual rows=1 loops=2023)\r\n                             Index Cond: (oid = att.atttypid)\r\n  (11 rows)\r\n--- 145,155 ----\r\n     ->  Unique (actual rows=1 loops=1)\r\n           ->  Sort (actual rows=1 loops=1)\r\n                 Sort Key: att.attnum, att.attname, (format_type(ty.oid, NULL::integer)), att.attnotnull, att.atthasdef\r\n!                Sort Method: quicksort  Memory: 394kB\r\n!                ->  Nested Loop (actual rows=2116 loops=1)\r\n!                      ->  Index Scan using pg_attribute_relid_attnum_index on pg_attribute att (actual rows=2116 loops=1)\r\n                             Index Cond: (attnum > 0)\r\n                             Filter: (attisdropped IS FALSE)\r\n!                      ->  Index Scan using pg_type_oid_index on pg_type ty (actual rows=1 loops=2116)\r\n                             Index Cond: (oid = att.atttypid)\r\n  (11 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe number of rows are different in the intermediate step but the final result is the same. Likely a false positive test.\r\n\r\nAlso, understand why the number of rows are different between 2.18 and master and change the test to be resilient to future changes in the number of rows.\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-7020]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7020?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17948/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"vbalvida","id":133920630,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_t3dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133920630?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida","html_url":"https://github.com/vbalvida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbalvida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.gith